                    "description": "校验页面",
                    "timeout": 20000,
                    "context": "website",
                    "code": "const users =\n  document.querySelectorAll(\"user-query\").length;\n\nconst assistants =\n  document.querySelectorAll(\"model-response\").length;\n\nconst total = users + assistants;\n\nif (total === 0) {\n  throw new Error(\n    \"未找到 Gemini 对话，请确认当前页面是 Gemini 聊天页面\"\n  );\n}\n\nautomaSetVariable(\"geminiPageCheck\", {\n  users,\n  assistants,\n  total,\n  url: location.href\n});\n\nconsole.log(\"[Gemini export] page check\", {\n  users,\n  assistants,\n  total\n});",
